DuckTales Recompiled @_ducktales_version@
========================================

A native Windows port of DuckTales (NES, Capcom, 1989), built by static
recompilation. This package contains no game data: you need your own copy of
the game's ROM. 64-bit Windows only; nothing else needs to be installed.


Supplying the ROM
-----------------

Only DuckTales (USA) is supported:

  File      DuckTales (USA).nes (131,088 bytes, iNES)
  SHA-256   97d472f7b2c1088448d1644155b2650a546bad887b3cba571e16d7986824c169

Start ducktales.exe, then pick the ROM in the window or drop the file on it.
The file is checked against the SHA-256 above; any other dump, revision or
modified file is refused. The checked copy is stored in
%APPDATA%\DuckTales Recompiled\, so later launches start the game directly.

From a command prompt you can import it without opening the window:

  ducktales.exe --import-rom "C:\path\to\DuckTales (USA).nes"


Controls
--------

  Action               Keyboard             Controller
  D-pad                Arrow keys           D-pad
  A / B                Z / X                A / X
  Start / Select       Return / Backslash   Start / Back
  Menu                 Escape               RB
  Fullscreen           F11, Alt+Enter
  Fast-forward (hold)  Tab                  RT
  Save / load state    F8 / F9

Every control can be rebound in the menu (Settings > Controls). Settings are
saved in config.ini next to ducktales.exe.


